WEBVTT

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.010
How about you hand over those there Bey parts, partner?

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:43.180
I'm sorry, but I can't give
parts to people without IDs.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.750
I'll get caught by BEGA.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:53.160
I don't care about BEGA! Don't you think
Beyblade should be freely enjoyed by everyone?!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.660
Well...

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:58.520
How dare you ask us
for a ridiculous ID card?!

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.010
I won't stand for being
mocked like this!

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.860
Don't move around!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.190
You stop moving!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.800
I can't see!

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.200
Calm down up there!

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.580
What did you--

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.730
Are you okay, sir?!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:28.140
Oh, I'm fine...

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.480
Sorry 'bout that...

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.740
Crap! Run for it!

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:41.440
He's headless!
Headless! Headless!

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:53.060
We're the world champions!

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:06.100
You can use whatever
parts we've got left.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:11.620
Sure! Since BEGA has a lock on all parts, anything helps!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.660
Even so...

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.240
This isn't much to work with.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:27.280
Darn! BEGA's basically
forcing us out!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:34.380
Yeah! Even those suppon-sirs
are all on BEGA's side now!

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:39.410
Daichi, we have to do whatever it
takes to get our hands on some parts!

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:44.320
Yeah! Let's show those BEGA creeps we mean business!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.450
Wait for me!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.840
Hurry up! All the new
parts are gonna sell out!

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.260
Sir! I'll take some
BEGA parts please!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.690
The new one!

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.320
Me too!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.570
Save some for me, sir!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.380
It's Takao Kinomiya!
The world champion!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.610
And Daichi Sumeragi, too!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:12.480
Sorry. I can't give you parts without an ID. Even if you're the champ.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.840
Sorry, boys.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.800
I'll take this one!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.920
One for me too!

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.680
Looks like they're
all having fun...

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.530
It's because they don't
know what Volkov's up to.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.930
But still...

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.770
C'mon, Daichi.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.380
No luck on your end, either?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:49.020
I went everywhere, but they
wouldn't serve me without an ID.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:53.850
At this rate, BEGA will
completely force us out.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:57.860
Why can't we use a Bey
with parts lying around?

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.900
Can't we win with what
we've been using anyway?

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:07.280
We don't have any hope of beating
BEGA with busted up Beys like those.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.580
We need new Beys.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:14.450
But Volkov has a
lockdown on all the parts.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.880
What are we supposed to do?!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.960
Isn't it obvious?

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.280
We just have to win!
No matter what!

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.200
That's all!

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.420
Yeah! Volkov's not
getting away with this!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.530
Were you even
listening to us, Takao?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.240
What?!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.920
What's the matter?

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.100
That's not like you.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:06:00.610
It's you!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.690
Hi!

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.220
Looks like you're
having it rough.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.690
We came with parts from America!
Everything you need to make new Beys!

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:16.060
Thank you so much!
With all of this...

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:21.370
Backup should be arriving
to see Takao and Max, too.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.580
All of you!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.010
The world championships are over!

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.940
Y'all want another go?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.690
That's not it.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:37.680
We heard all about it.
You guys are up to something cool.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.020
Something cool, huh?

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.810
Those BEGA guys
are strong, right?

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:46.130
This isn't your
problem anymore.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:50.360
He's right. This is our
problem too now!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.100
Don't hide it from us, Rei!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:54.170
That's right, Rei!

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:57.810
You can rely
on us a little!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.770
You're here to
fight BEGA with us?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.410
Thank you all!

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.600
You guys are great!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.680
It brings me to tears!

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:11.220
Now the whole gang's here!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.870
We won't let Volkov beat us!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.840
I know I said that, but
BEGA is one tough customer.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:26.300
They were able to
beat Yuriy that badly...

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:32.460
I don't think any one of us could
put Yuriy into a condition like that.

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.010
Definitely not...

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.900
Why are y'all so bummed?!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:46.440
I don't know how strong they are,
but we just gotta be stronger than that!

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.000
What a simpleton.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.490
What?!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:54.300
Daichi has a point.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:08:00.050
Surpassing BEGA the only way
we can protect Beyblading.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.450
That's right, Rei.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:06.080
But what Beys will
we fight BEGA with?

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.640
BEGA has a lockdown
on all the parts...

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.730
About that...

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.320
Kyoujyu!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.440
Look at this.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.360
What is it?

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:21.400
It's a specification sheet
for a new Beyblade.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.320
Can you make
a new Beyblade?

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.500
Really?!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:30.010
I managed to make it with help from Emily and Michael.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.090
Problem solved!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.210
And I getting worried
there for a sec!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.050
There's still one problem.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.160
Problem?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.980
What is it, Kyoujyu?

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:47.650
Well... This Beyblade is an
entirely new development.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:53.300
If we want to beat BEGA, it'll have to be
a stronger Beyblade than ever before.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.010
Isn't that a good thing?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.780
Faster rotation.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.940
High power. High speed.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:08.500
We designed it with such high specifications,
so you'll need a lot of control to master it.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:14.940
Does that mean we aren't
strong enough to master it?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:19.480
These new Beys will
be much stronger...

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.280
Than your wildest of
expectations. That's it.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.970
No way...

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:28.060
A Beyblade beyond
our wildest dreams...

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.880
I like the sound of that!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:36.860
I'll be the first to master
this new class of Beyblade!

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:39.080
No, it'll be me!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:39.770
What?!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.400
You got a problem?

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.960
I'm first!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.690
And we...

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.960
Can't just sit and watch!

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.100
Okay!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.730
Kyoujyu, we're counting on you
guys to develop this new Beyblade!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:59.660
And we'll train
like hell to master it!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.620
And training means...

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.920
--At that training camp!
--At that training camp!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.040
--Training! Training!

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.410
Are you okay?

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:21.600
--Training! Training!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:25.140
--Training from day 'till night!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:27.700
Don't get
celebrating just yet.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.440
What is it?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:34.780
The reps for the battle
haven't been set yet.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.460
Hey now...

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:42.170
Even if you're the champ, if you can't master that Bey, you're off the team.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:46.410
This is our problem
now, after all.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:51.360
Any of us could become
one of the five reps!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.600
You're kidding, right?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.960
Well...

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:59.570
BEGA has that girl,
Ming-Ming on their team, right?

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.220
Right...

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.450
Yeah...

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:08.130
We should have a girl
represent us too, right?

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:10.890
We have a chance!

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.920
Me too?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.770
Yay!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.570
You too...

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.890
Too bad.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.560
It's...!

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.020
The hag!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.570
I thought the bus guide
was kind of off! It was you?!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.250
The female Blader
on this team...

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:41.120
Will be me!
The BBA's ultimate weapon!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:43.580
Says who?

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:48.840
Let me show you! I'm not on the
BBA just because of my pretty face!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:55.380
Hiromi Star Flash!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.610
--A wand?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.850
That's my Einstein...

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.500
When did you...

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:21.580
Three! Two! One!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.840
Go, Shoot!

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:25.860
Huh?!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.050
Don't "huh" us!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.350
Stop it, hag!

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.810
This wasn't supposed to...

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:39.770
Don't Beyblade in tight areas or places with lots of people!

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.780
Anyone who does that
isn't a real Blader!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.050
Promise us, kids!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.100
Let's get started.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.600
Why are you
ordering us around?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:13:00.840
I have to. People won't
take orders from a loser.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.800
Loser?!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.900
Rick, you--

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.210
Am I wrong?

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:10.730
Stop fighting, guys!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.890
--Stay outta this, black cat!

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:18.130
Black cat?! Funny, coming
from the bull and the bird!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.010
You wanna piece
of me, black cat?

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.010
Bring it!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.600
Rai's such a hothead...

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:28.120
He'll lose and get
all depressed again...

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.370
That's a cold way to
talk about your brother.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.090
Does China not have the
concept of brotherly love?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:41.640
I think it's a little weird to have such
a strong love for your own brother!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:44.360
What?!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.800
Um...

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:50.920
I think we need to figure out who's the strongest here.

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:56.250
Then let me prove
to you who that is!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.300
Looks like things are
heating up over there.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.580
Come on, Mao...

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.100
Sis...

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.300
--Shut up!

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.100
--Sure...

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.450
Is it a good idea to leave
the kids by themselves?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:20.250
It's fine. They're working hard to
save the world of Beyblading.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.170
How true.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.610
They grow up so fast.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:27.610
Growing up, huh...

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.380
As a father, I'm glad.
But it's a little sad...

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:36.860
I agree. All we can do is make sure a
piping hot meal is waiting for them

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:40.600
when they
come home hungry.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.370
How true!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.810
Hiromi, I think we're
good on apples...

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.380
Okay.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:56.340
I'll show you just
who's the strongest!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.770
Be my guest!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:15:00.240
I won't lose either!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:01.980
Here I come!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.860
--Three! Two! One!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.930
Go, Shoot!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.940
Go, Galux!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.280
You can do it, Pierce Hedgehog!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.980
Knock them all away!
Thunder Pegasus!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.290
Don't stop yet!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.300
I'm gonna crush you!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.650
No, don't!

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:33.880
Sounds like they're having fun.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.860
Sure does.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:39.880
Are you two fine
staying up here?

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:44.880
Completing this
new Bey is important.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:49.460
We all feel the same way, even if we're
working from behind the scenes.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:55.730
Let's finish these new
Beys so we can keep up!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:56.770
Sure!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:06.460
It's rare to see Takao running like this! He hates exercise!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:10.600
He always blows off practice
sessions with grandpa!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:15.500
Yeah! Our battle with BEGA
is too important to lose!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:19.660
So I'm gonna start from square one
so I teach that Volkov a lesson!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:24.460
You're right. Losing up to now meant a loss for ourselves.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:29.210
But losing here means Beyblading
will fall into Volkov's grasp!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:33.810
Which means it doesn't matter if it's
exercise or training or practice I have to do!

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:36.560
We gotta do it all!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:39.090
That's the spirit!

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:41.970
Follow me!

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:44.170
Wait up, Daichi!

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.570
Mayonnaise is
good on curry too!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.730
That's it!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.080
Go, Galeon!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.380
Keep it up!

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:04.780
All right! Here I go!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.890
Toda La Fuerza!

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.580
Catty...

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.440
Bites!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:19.470
Poison Needle!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.460
No way...

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.540
Yay!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:50.900
What's wrong? Us girls will take all the
spots on the team if that's all you've got.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.490
She's right!

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:55.130
Yeah! Let's all do our best!

00:17:56.490 --> 00:18:00.240
Girl power! Power! Power!

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:45.010
Something wrong, Takao?

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:47.530
What? You weirdo.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:54.440
Ever since we started this fight with BEGA, we've
been away from all these people who support us.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.070
You're right.

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:01.100
I was a little shocked.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:02.500
Takao...

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:09.690
BEGA undid everything we've
done in the blink of an eye.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.500
That's how I felt.

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.220
But now...

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.600
Not anymore.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:19.420
We have all these
friends and rivals.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:23.450
And that makes me happy.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.290
Of course.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.800
With friends and
rivals like you guys...

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.660
We'll never lose to BEGA!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.660
We will win!

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:37.400
Yeah, Takao!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.560
That's obvious!

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.540
--We will win!
--We will win!

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:42.920
We have to.

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:44.570
Yeah!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.660
--We will win!
--We will win!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.560
Takao!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.830
Kyoujyu!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:54.630
It's done! The new
Beyblade is complete!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:58.820
Wow!
The new Beyblade is done!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.140
Yes!
We just finished it.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:05.210
This is your new Bey.
Dragoon Metal Storm.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:08.290
Dragoon Metal Storm...

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.760
It's smaller than
a typical Bey.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:16.960
But it has more power
packed into it than ever before?

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.260
Good job, Kyoujyu.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:26.420
No, it was all thanks
to Emily and Mihael's help.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.250
Thank you all!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:32.200
Takao, give it a try!

